1
00:00:00,655 --> 00:00:04,605
Well, as you can see, I am surprised and overwhelmed by this award.

2
00:00:05,455 --> 00:00:13,070
I'd especially like to dedicate the “Young Entrepreneur of the Year” trophy to my mother, who has always supported me.

3
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:19,055
Actually, it was in my mother's garage that I developed my hobby into a successful business.

4
00:00:20,495 --> 00:00:24,735
I started as a child, building the electronic project kits that she bought me.

5
00:00:25,495 --> 00:00:30,035
I soon began making modifications, and from there I moved on to design.

6
00:00:30,765 --> 00:00:36,395
Now I provide secure computer networks for large corporations all over North America.

7
00:00:37,215 --> 00:00:42,015
Well, I'm one of those lucky people who have become rich doing what they love!

8
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:45,435
Thanks again to everybody who has made it possible.
